// Page HeroIntro Text :
"P3680026034" "What issue would you like to look at?"
// Answer Text :
"P2465858369" "Issue 12"
// Page Issue12Hero Text :
"P2714442424" "Hollows Repeatable Missions<br>Security Level: 5 - 15<br><br>Meg Mason is an uncover cop recently relocated to the Hollows. She has a number of repeatable missions for heroes. You can find in NEIGBORHOOD, by the water tower.<br><br>The Midnight Squad<br>Security Level: 10 - 20<br>The Midnight Squad is seeking new members. Talk to Montague Castanella inside the University in Steel Canyon for more information.<br><br>The Origin of Power<br>Security Level: 30 - 50<br>Percy Winkley is sending heroes around to talk to a member of each of the five origins. Anyone interested should talk to him just outside of the University in Croatoa.<br><br>Time's Arrow<br>Security Level: 35 - 50<br>Heroes who have earned the Midnighter badge are able to gain access to an Ouroboros time travel crystal within the Midnighter Club. The crystal is tuned to travel only to a single time and place, ancient Cimerora. Once there both heroes and villains are asked to seek out Imperious for further instructions. Talk to Montague Castanella in the Steel Canyon University for more information.<br><br>Tale of Cimerora<br>Security Level: 35 - 50<br>Senator Aquila is welcoming both heroes and villains to the land of Cimerora. He asks that you take some time to get to know the locals before moving onto other adventures. You can find the Senator at the entrance to town. To enter Cimerora, you must have a pass into the Midnighter Club and be Security level 35.<br><br>Cimerora Repeatable Missions<br>Security Level: 35 - 50<br>In ancient Cimerora, Captain Valerius is asking for assistance regarding various threats in and around Cimerora. If you are able to travel back to this time, seek him out at the top of the walk way."
// Page VillainIntro Text :
"P940415443" "You're a villain."
// DisplayName for N_Bartender :
"P827702512" "Content NPC"

